iterations.reply:
The enrichment fetch is removed. The node's `with` clause grants only `StateHandle<'subscriptions', read>`, so the component cannot import `aap:caps/http-client@0.1.0` until the graph definition actually grants it. Once the next release adds `HTTPClient` to this node's `with` clause, the import and the enrichment call can go back in.

I also made one other change: an empty store now produces an empty `urls` list instead of a trap. `present(urls)` holds of an empty list.

